00:16:03.992 --> 00:16:05.700
This can lead to
conversational commerce,

00:16:05.700 --> 00:16:07.560
or even assist the
decision-making.

00:16:07.560 --> 00:16:10.140
For example, determining
which department you'll need

00:16:10.140 --> 00:16:13.380
